{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52018","headline":"春日还庄 · 王绩","name":"春日还庄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"居人姓仲长，端坐悦年光。\n地形疑谷口，川势似河阳。\n傍山移草石，横渠种稻粱。\n滋兰依旧畹，接菓着新行。\n自持茅作屋，无用杏爲梁。\n蓬埋张仲径，藜破管宁牀。\n浴蚕温织室，分蜂煖蜜房。\n竹密连堦暗，花飞满宅香。\n坐棠思邵伯，看柳忆嵇康。\n自得终焉趣，无论怀故乡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王绩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52018.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52018","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}